  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Load all knowledge files. Declare RIGOR LEVEL STANDARD + reason (escalate to FULL if the save discriminant is touched). Confirm task 020 canonical model is in place.</step>
    <step order="1">Map how header/footer content, section properties, and page breaks are captured in the canonical model (task 020) and authored via AppendSection (:142).</step>
    <step order="2">Route headers/footers + page breaks through the canonical model: projection captures them; the renderer authors valid w:headerReference/w:footerReference (+ header/footer parts) and page-break markup on the save path.</step>
    <step order="3">Add a seam slice in tests/integration/seam/Compose/: header/footer content + page breaks load → edit → save → reopen without hard-fail.</step>
    <step order="4">Run dotnet publish -c Release; report absolute size + delta vs ~49.63 MB. Run /conflict-check; state Placement Justification.</step>
    <step order="5">Run/verify: BFF build + this task's seam slice + Tier-1 NetArchTest pass.</step>
    <step order="6">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅ completed.</step>
    <step order="7">Document any deviation in projects/spaarkeai-compose-r6/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
